### IPP-404 Topics tests
### BEFORE testing, in the server folder run:
###   npm run backup     (safety copy)
###   npm run seed       (adds the 5 PHP topics and sets the topic of all 40 questions; ids stay the same)
### Then `npm run dev` and send the requests below, top to bottom.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### Put real passwords only while testing, then put CHANGE_ME back
@adminEmail = raeeschechi302@gmail.com
@adminPassword = dingdongdingdonghilalkidingdongbubble
@userEmail = arsalmustafa62+ipp2@gmail.com
@userPassword = secret456

@phpId = 6ad894999dcf1f882fd249b2
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}
@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.data.token}}
@testQ = {{newQ.response.body.data.question._id}}


### 1. PHP with topics -> expect "topics": 5 items with qaCount / mcqCount:
###    basics-syntax 4/6, operators-types 3/5, oop 5/3, web-security 5/3, modern-php-tooling 3/3
GET {{baseUrl}}/languages/php


### 2. Public Q&A of one topic -> expect total 5, every question "topic": "oop"
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?language=php&topic=oop


### 3. Tags inside a topic (for the filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/tags?language=php&topic=web-security


### 4. Admin login -> expect 200
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }


### 5. Add a question WITHOUT topic -> expect 400 "Choose a topic"
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "{{phpId}}", "type": "qa", "question": "TEST (IPP-404) topic question", "answer": "Test answer" }


### 6. Wrong topic -> expect 400 "This topic does not belong to the chosen language"
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "{{phpId}}", "type": "qa", "topic": "cooking", "question": "TEST (IPP-404) topic question", "answer": "Test answer" }


### 7. Correct topic -> expect 201 "Question added", "topic": "oop"
# @name newQ
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "{{phpId}}", "type": "qa", "topic": "oop", "question": "TEST (IPP-404) topic question", "answer": "Test answer" }


### 8. Delete the test question -> expect 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/questions/{{testQ}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 9. Try to remove the "oop" topic (it has questions) -> expect 409 "Topic "oop" has 8 questions..."
PUT {{baseUrl}}/languages/{{phpId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topics": [
    { "name": "Basics & Syntax", "slug": "basics-syntax" },
    { "name": "Operators & Types", "slug": "operators-types" },
    { "name": "Web & Security", "slug": "web-security" },
    { "name": "Modern PHP & Tooling", "slug": "modern-php-tooling" }
  ]
}


### 10. Rename a topic (same slug = questions stay) -> expect 200, "OOP" now "Object-Oriented PHP"
PUT {{baseUrl}}/languages/{{phpId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topics": [
    { "name": "Basics & Syntax", "slug": "basics-syntax" },
    { "name": "Operators & Types", "slug": "operators-types" },
    { "name": "Object-Oriented PHP", "slug": "oop" },
    { "name": "Web & Security", "slug": "web-security" },
    { "name": "Modern PHP & Tooling", "slug": "modern-php-tooling" }
  ]
}


### 11. Put the name back to "OOP" -> expect 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/languages/{{phpId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topics": [
    { "name": "Basics & Syntax", "slug": "basics-syntax" },
    { "name": "Operators & Types", "slug": "operators-types" },
    { "name": "OOP", "slug": "oop" },
    { "name": "Web & Security", "slug": "web-security" },
    { "name": "Modern PHP & Tooling", "slug": "modern-php-tooling" }
  ]
}


### 12. Topic quiz (admin = full access) -> expect 201, 3 questions (OOP has 3 MCQs), "timeLimit": 90
POST {{baseUrl}}/quiz/start
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "php", "topic": "oop" }


### 13. Unknown topic -> expect 400 "Topic not found"
POST {{baseUrl}}/quiz/start
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "php", "topic": "cooking" }


### 14. Unpaid user login -> expect 200
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{userEmail}}", "password": "{{userPassword}}" }


### 15. Unpaid user with a topic -> topic is ignored: sample quiz, 5 questions, "topic": null
POST {{baseUrl}}/quiz/start
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "php", "topic": "oop" }
